(10,'Nutrition label','The panel on food packaging showing calorie count, nutrients, and percent daily values.'),
(11,'Body Mass Index (BMI)','A ratio of weight to height used as a screening tool for healthy weight — not a diagnosis.'),
(11,'Metabolism','The rate at which your body converts food into energy — affects weight management.'),
(11,'Basal metabolic rate','The number of calories your body needs to maintain basic functions at rest.'),
(11,'Caloric balance','The relationship between calories consumed and calories burned through activity.'),
(11,'Body image','The way you see and feel about your physical appearance.'),
(11,'Eating disorder','A serious mental illness with extreme disturbances in eating behavior, body image, and weight.'),
(11,'Anorexia nervosa','An eating disorder involving extreme restriction of food intake driven by fear of weight gain.'),
(11,'Bulimia nervosa','An eating disorder with cycles of binge eating followed by purging.'),
