(23,'Infection','The condition that results when pathogens multiply in the body and damage cells.'),
(23,'Vector','An organism (such as a mosquito or tick) that carries and transmits pathogens.'),
(23,'Immune system','The body''s network of cells, tissues, organs, and chemicals that fight pathogens.'),
